      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "At age 30, ABC-treated participants completed 1.15 more years of education than controls (13.46 vs 12.31).",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "In the ABC randomized treatment comparison, the age-30 outcome was F(1,99)=9.60, p<.01, d=0.62, with a 95% CI of 0.42 to 1.90 years. The analysis used 52 treated and 49 control participants and is ABC-only, not pooled ABC/CARE evidence.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "da4a6c1f9d4446f9832ff3b49a4400ef"
